//
//  FloatAvoidPlanTests.swift
//  Wave-53 lane L4 pins on the VERBATIM wave52-ship per-test IR (byte-identical
//  to wave53-open) — twin of Compose FloatAvoidPlanTest.kt, same pins, same
//  numbers. GENERATED by tools/titan/results/wave53-float-avoid/gen-pins.py from
//  the .tmpl beside it: the literals at the bottom are the corpus files' bytes
//  and testVerbatim re-hashes each. The BFC height h is INJECTED (a device
//  measurement); FloatAvoidLayoutRasterTests executes the real Layout.
